### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testlogin@gmail.com",
  "password": "Testlogin123",
  "fullName": "Test Login"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "datpham@gmail.com",
  "password": "datpham123"
}

### View profile
GET http://localhost:8080/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update profile
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "fullName": "Pham Duc Dat",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "address": "123 Nguyen Hue, Q1, TPHCM"
}

### Get Family Members (Auto-creates 'self')
GET http://localhost:8080/family
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Health Conditions
GET http://localhost:8080/family/conditions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add Family Member
POST http://localhost:8080/family
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "displayName": "Con trai",
  "relationship": "child",
  "gender": "male",
  "birthDate": "2015-05-20",
  "heightCm": 120.5,
  "weightKg": 25.0,
  "activityLevel": "high",
  "healthNotes": "Dị ứng hải sản",
  "conditionIds": []
}

### Evaluate recommended dishes by AI (store score/result)
POST http://localhost:8080/recommendations/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Re-evaluate recommended dishes by AI (manual button)
POST http://localhost:8080/recommendations/re-evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get recommendation list (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/recommendations?page=0&size=8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
